# Environment reference only. DO NOT copy this aggregate file into an app.
# All checked-in project URLs and public keys are generic examples.
# A supplied service-role key was exposed and MUST be rotated before use. Never
# put its value in documentation or either frontend environment.
# Actual local env files contain public project values and placeholders for the
# rotated service-role key and replacement JWT secrets.
# Use each app's least-privilege template instead:
#
#   cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
#   cp customer-app/.env.example customer-app/.env.local
#   cp internal-dashboard/.env.example internal-dashboard/.env.local
#
# backend/.env.example
#   SUPABASE_URL
#   SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY       rotated key; backend and offline seed only
#   JWT_SECRET_KEY                  replacement shared secret
#   JWT_ALGORITHM
#   ENVIRONMENT
#   LOG_LEVEL
#   CORS_ORIGINS
#   OPENAI_API_KEY
#   CHAT_MODEL
#   MANUAL_RESOLVER_MODEL
#   MEDIA_MEAL_RESOLVER_MODEL
#   VISION_MODEL
#   AUDIO_MODEL
#   LANGSMITH_API_KEY              optional runtime agent prompt registry
#   LANGSMITH_ENDPOINT
#   LANGSMITH_WORKSPACE_ID
#   LANGSMITH_PROJECT
#   LANGSMITH_TRACING
#   REDIS_URL
#
# customer-app/.env.example and internal-dashboard/.env.example
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL        public Supabase Auth endpoint
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY   public Supabase Auth key
#   BACKEND_API_URL                 Next.js server only
#   BACKEND_JWT_SECRET              Next.js server only; matches JWT_SECRET_KEY
#
# Never add SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY to either frontend environment or docs.
